# Cursor AI Rules for Z-Systems (d:\zn)

🔴 MANDATORY CONSTITUTION FOR CURSOR:
Read and strictly follow `SAAS_ELECTRON_ISOLATION_CONSTITUTION.md` and `GEMINI.md` before making any code modifications.

1. ARCHITECTURAL BOUNDARY:
- Cloud SaaS is deployed on Oracle Cloud VPS (`APP_MODE=CLOUD_SAAS`).
- Desktop Electron is `APP_MODE=SELF_CONTAINED`.
- NEVER mix desktop logic into SaaS core or exclude the `zs` platform tenant.
- Maintain double-entry accounting ledgers and multi-tenant data isolation (`tenant_id`).

2. BUILD & PUSH RULES:
- NEVER run `npm run build` or `git push` automatically without explicit user command.

3. UI & ARABIC CONSTITUTION:
- Default RTL (`dir="rtl"`).
- Chat responses wrapped in `<div dir="rtl">...</div>`.
- 0 Emojis in UI (use `@/shared/components/icons/AppIcons`).
- Standard Modals (`StandardDialog` / `DialogShell`) & Comboboxes (`CustomSelect`).
